abstract: >-
  Research scaffold for Hotel Traveling Salesman Problem optimization with
  Tensor-QUDO and QUBO formulations, solved with QAOA (Cirq, CUDA-Q) and
  simulated annealing. The software and data accompany the ASQC 2026 paper
  "Benchmarking QAOA on a Tensor-Based QUDO Formulation of a TSP Variant for
  Travel Search Engines". The QUDO, Tensor-QUDO and HOBO formalism used by the
  work is described in arXiv:2508.01958.
keywords:
  - quantum optimization
  - QAOA
  - QUDO
  - Tensor-QUDO
  - QUBO
  - traveling salesman problem
  - simulated annealing
